OL,3,GNEWSAFlight disruption and thousands
OL,4,Awithout electricity after Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights have also been cancelled at
OL,7,FBelfast City, Belfast International and
OL,8,FDublin Airports due to the storm.
